  "body": "Perfectly situated in one of the most sought-after neighbourhoods, this sophisticated brand-new standalone home offers effortless, timeless, and high-quality family living.\r\nThe ground floor is designed for everyday comfort and connection - featuring a sleek, contemporary open-plan kitchen with premium appliances, and a spacious dining and living area that seamlessly flows onto a sunny deck - the perfect setting for both relaxation and entertaining. A double bedroom with ensuite and a separate guest toilet adds extra convenience and flexibility for family or visitors.\r\nUpstairs, discover four beautifully appointed bedrooms, including a spacious master suite with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite. A full family bathroom serves the remaining three bedrooms, each complete with built-in double wardrobes.\r\nKey Features:\r\n•Standalone home with freehold title\r\n•Five generous bedrooms and three and a half bathrooms, including two ensuites\r\n•Internal-access garage with dedicated laundry and storage space\r\n• Equipped with three air conditioning units for year-round comfort\r\n•Prime education zone - only a 5-minute walk to Macleans Primary, BBI, and Macleans College\r\n•Minutes from Half Moon Bay ferry terminal - easy commute to Auckland City\r\n•Close to reserves, beaches, local shops, bakery, and eateries\r\n•Comes with a standard 10-year builder warranty and 1-year free maintenance period\r\nThis stunning, highly functional home combines modern comfort with unbeatable convenience, offering your family the lifestyle you've been dreaming of.\r\nDon't miss out - call now to arrange your private viewing!",
